WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:04.270
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.270 --> 00:07.100
Become entwined in chains

00:07.100 --> 00:10.540
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.540 --> 00:14.910
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.910 --> 00:21.040
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.320 --> 00:26.580
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.390 --> 00:32.660
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.460 --> 00:38.960
Just one life that is out there

00:40.470 --> 00:45.740
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.540 --> 00:52.310
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.310 --> 00:58.650
Must surely exist

00:58.650 --> 01:01.920
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.920 --> 01:04.860
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.860 --> 01:08.200
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.200 --> 01:12.570
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.570 --> 01:16.970
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:34.320 --> 01:36.790
Ow! Ow!

01:37.790 --> 01:40.780
Hey, are you giving that to a guy?

01:43.670 --> 01:45.670
Then give it to me!

01:45.670 --> 01:47.270
No!

01:47.270 --> 01:49.260
I'm giving this to Mr. Alien!

01:50.270 --> 01:51.670
Ribbit.

01:51.670 --> 01:53.740
And it's really big!

01:53.740 --> 01:54.780
And?

01:54.780 --> 01:55.770
What happened?

01:58.410 --> 01:59.850
Sheesh...

01:59.850 --> 02:02.320
It's a different affair,
not having enemy attacks.

02:02.320 --> 02:05.320
Since when have you fallen
into the ranks of the military?

02:05.320 --> 02:07.490
But the morale of the crew...

02:07.490 --> 02:10.430
Our business is piracy, right?

02:10.430 --> 02:12.090
That is true, but...

02:18.200 --> 02:19.790
Look, look, look!

02:22.770 --> 02:23.760
Huh?

02:26.840 --> 02:28.170
Mr. Alien?

02:29.180 --> 02:30.440
Aren't you here?

02:32.550 --> 02:34.750
That's strange.

02:34.750 --> 02:36.770
I heard that he was here.

02:42.590 --> 02:43.790
Geez...

02:43.790 --> 02:45.260
She's just annoying!

02:52.770 --> 02:53.760
Boo!

02:54.800 --> 02:55.960
Not here...

02:57.740 --> 02:58.730
Boo!

03:00.070 --> 03:01.060
Shoot.

03:13.860 --> 03:14.840
All right!

03:35.410 --> 03:37.000
There we go!

03:48.860 --> 03:50.550
W-What the hell is this?

03:56.430 --> 03:57.590
Damn you, wake up!

04:02.440 --> 04:03.440
Welcome back!

04:03.440 --> 04:04.940
Enough of that!

04:04.940 --> 04:06.930
What are you doing
in someone else's room?

04:13.250 --> 04:15.650
See? Look, look, look!

04:15.650 --> 04:17.620
It's all nice and neat, right?

04:17.620 --> 04:18.720
Neat?

04:18.720 --> 04:19.720
How is this...

04:19.720 --> 04:21.420
Oh, that's right!

04:21.420 --> 04:22.580
- Listen when others...
- Here!

04:24.430 --> 04:26.420
Get out!

04:34.000 --> 04:35.640
Dita?

04:35.640 --> 04:37.000
Oh... Leader...

04:39.740 --> 04:45.350
And then he said I was
in the way and to get out.

04:45.350 --> 04:49.850
I just wanted Mr. Alien to be happy,

04:49.850 --> 04:51.620
but I always make him mad.

04:51.620 --> 04:52.610
Dita...

04:54.160 --> 04:56.020
I can't put this into words well...

04:56.020 --> 04:59.690
And I don't intend to condone
your curiosity, but...

04:59.690 --> 05:01.060
What is it?

05:01.060 --> 05:03.930
I have something against trying
to enter someone's heart,

05:03.930 --> 05:05.260
when they're not ready for it.

05:07.740 --> 05:09.170
You're right...

05:10.510 --> 05:14.370
Why? Why? Why?

05:15.510 --> 05:16.500
Why?

05:17.510 --> 05:18.610
More...

05:18.610 --> 05:22.240
I just want to know
more about Mr. Alien...

05:23.320 --> 05:26.650
I took a shot with the aura
camera that Parfet made for me.

05:26.650 --> 05:28.490
Dita, are you depressed right now?

05:28.490 --> 05:30.830
Can't you tell just by looking?

05:30.830 --> 05:34.500
It's just like when the bluebird
that I used to own died.

05:34.500 --> 05:35.660
A bluebird?

05:36.900 --> 05:39.270
It was the first
time I had a bluebird.

05:39.270 --> 05:42.000
So I was happy,
and I pet it every day,

05:42.000 --> 05:44.600
but it started losing
energy and died one day.

05:45.810 --> 05:49.170
Maybe that bird got tired
because you kept messing with it.

05:51.280 --> 05:52.880
Is Mr. Alien...

05:52.880 --> 05:54.750
Is Mr. Alien tired, too?

05:54.750 --> 05:57.420
- Wait, um...
- Is he tired when he's with me?

05:57.420 --> 05:58.790
Th-That reminds me,

05:58.790 --> 06:02.220
Hibiki did say that he gets
tired when he's with Dita!

06:02.220 --> 06:03.780
It can't be...

06:08.760 --> 06:10.130
Dita?

06:10.130 --> 06:11.430
I see...

06:11.430 --> 06:15.070
So he does think
that I get in his way...

06:15.070 --> 06:17.940
N-No, I didn't say
that it was that bad.

06:17.940 --> 06:19.610
Dita, it was a joke.

06:19.610 --> 06:21.140
You understand, right?

06:21.140 --> 06:22.480
Dita?

06:22.480 --> 06:24.610
Ribbit? Ribbit?

06:24.610 --> 06:25.950
Captain!

06:25.950 --> 06:29.680
I want to solidify the Dread
formations while we have the time.

06:29.680 --> 06:32.050
You and BC...

06:32.050 --> 06:34.360
Why can't you rest every so often?

06:34.360 --> 06:35.920
With all due respect,

06:35.920 --> 06:38.630
the day of the "razing"
is quickly approaching.

06:38.630 --> 06:41.360
I don't think that
we have the time to rest...

06:42.700 --> 06:44.360
You're as hardheaded as ever.

06:46.370 --> 06:47.930
You're late.

06:48.940 --> 06:50.200
Where's Dita?

06:50.200 --> 06:51.440
Like I know!

06:51.440 --> 06:53.410
I'm not her babysitter!

06:53.410 --> 06:55.010
Oh my...

06:55.010 --> 06:57.450
I'm sure it's some lover's quarrel.

06:57.450 --> 06:58.880
Give me a break!

06:58.880 --> 07:00.250
Why would I...

07:00.250 --> 07:01.770
I'm sorry I'm late.

07:15.530 --> 07:17.030
All right, everyone's here.

07:17.030 --> 07:20.570
I will now explain the
simulation we'll be doing today.

07:20.570 --> 07:23.440
First of all, the formation we'll
get in when Dita combines...

07:23.440 --> 07:24.670
It's all right.

07:25.670 --> 07:26.740
It's all right.

07:26.740 --> 07:28.610
I won't be combining anymore.

07:34.920 --> 07:36.420
I get it.

07:36.420 --> 07:39.480
You've gotten tired of the
alien now, haven't you?

07:41.790 --> 07:45.530
Mr. Alien can't be happy with me.

07:45.530 --> 07:48.620
So from now on,
you can combine with him, Jura.

07:53.530 --> 07:54.520
Dita!

07:55.600 --> 07:59.240
I can't acknowledge comments
that mix public and private matters.

07:59.240 --> 08:00.970
This isn't a game!

08:03.180 --> 08:04.640
I'm sorry.

08:05.210 --> 08:08.180
Barnette here.
I'm linking with the simulator.

08:08.180 --> 08:10.350
I'm fine, too. Meia,
can you hear me?

08:10.350 --> 08:11.990
Yeah, I hear you just fine.

08:11.990 --> 08:13.720
Dita, what's wrong?

08:13.720 --> 08:15.120
- Dita?
- R-Right!

08:15.120 --> 08:16.110
I'm sorry!

08:22.500 --> 08:23.830
I'm all ready!

08:25.630 --> 08:27.790
I'm always ready to welcome you.

08:29.970 --> 08:32.570
All units, check your
assigned coordinates quickly.

08:32.570 --> 08:33.910
Hibiki here. Check!

08:33.910 --> 08:35.880
Barnette here. OK!

08:35.880 --> 08:37.450
Dita, what's wrong?

08:37.450 --> 08:38.430
Right!

08:41.280 --> 08:43.350
Dita, your response time is dropping!

08:43.350 --> 08:44.390
Concentrate!

08:44.390 --> 08:45.620
I'm sorry!

08:45.620 --> 08:46.950
That's no good at all.

08:46.950 --> 08:48.860
Her mind's somewhere else.

08:48.860 --> 08:49.890
Next!

08:49.890 --> 08:51.260
Pai-check!

08:52.490 --> 08:54.560
There aren't any enemies
in this area, right?

08:54.560 --> 08:55.700
There's no doubt about it.

08:55.700 --> 08:58.000
Then can you do a
long-range scan right now?

08:58.000 --> 08:58.870
Sure.

08:58.870 --> 09:01.100
Don't worry so much.

09:01.100 --> 09:03.400
Why don't you relax a bit, Vice-captain?

09:03.400 --> 09:04.940
Would you like some?

09:04.940 --> 09:08.280
I get so hungry lately,
no matter how much I eat!

09:08.280 --> 09:10.270
You're eating too much, lady.

09:11.250 --> 09:14.080
First she was sleeping and
now it's a maternity-high...

09:17.920 --> 09:20.720
Hey, there really is
something strange about them.

09:28.430 --> 09:29.960
You're right...

09:29.960 --> 09:31.530
See? See?

09:31.530 --> 09:33.090
This is my chance, right?

09:34.740 --> 09:35.720
I guess...

09:41.710 --> 09:44.680
Hey, you can sit across
from me, you know.

09:44.680 --> 09:47.380
Wasn't that assigned as Dita's seat?

09:47.380 --> 09:49.920
W-Who the hell decided that?

09:49.920 --> 09:50.910
Geez...

09:52.120 --> 09:54.860
You should increase your calcium intake.

09:54.860 --> 09:56.480
You don't need to be so damn nosy!

09:57.490 --> 09:59.130
Aren't you going to eat?

09:59.130 --> 10:01.860
I decided that I was going to change.

10:01.860 --> 10:06.090
Because the way I am
now is bad for Mr. Alien.

10:13.070 --> 10:14.610
Hold it.

10:14.610 --> 10:16.380
Out of the way.

10:16.380 --> 10:17.380
What is it?

10:17.380 --> 10:18.650
Hibiki, you're lonely!

10:18.650 --> 10:20.580
What was that, you little...

10:20.580 --> 10:23.050
You're lonely because Dita
isn't coming to bug you.

10:24.050 --> 10:25.880
I-I'll break you up, you little...

10:28.520 --> 10:29.960
It's better for you to be honest!

10:31.760 --> 10:33.090
Let me tell you...

10:33.090 --> 10:35.830
I hate people like that!

10:35.830 --> 10:37.820
I'm feeling much better
now that she's gone!

10:44.040 --> 10:45.030
Uh...

10:52.210 --> 10:53.940
Dita, wait!

10:59.120 --> 11:00.420
Hated me...

11:00.420 --> 11:01.450
He said he hated me...

11:08.400 --> 11:09.390
Dita?

11:10.830 --> 11:11.860
Ezra!

11:13.670 --> 11:15.530
- Ezra...
- Oh my...

11:23.880 --> 11:25.510
Well, now.

11:25.510 --> 11:28.850
What do you want
to ask me about, ladies?

11:28.850 --> 11:31.720
You should become
good friends with Dita.

11:34.020 --> 11:36.920
You know, Dita is getting in my way.

11:36.920 --> 11:39.990
So I want you to
act as Dita's babysitter.

11:39.990 --> 11:42.130
Then I can take that boy.

11:42.130 --> 11:44.700
But what good does that do me?

11:44.700 --> 11:45.830
You're an idiot.

11:45.830 --> 11:49.440
If you get Dita on your side,
you can be very popular on this ship!

11:49.440 --> 11:52.640
Your treatment and your food
will be exceptional then!

11:52.640 --> 11:55.140
Exceptional... huh?

11:55.140 --> 11:56.340
Oh, is that so?

11:59.350 --> 12:00.680
That's not bad...

12:02.050 --> 12:03.640
I want to do it soon...

12:12.630 --> 12:14.250
I can't keep up with them...

12:16.160 --> 12:19.670
I've developed an appetite after
getting over the morning sickness.

12:19.670 --> 12:22.330
No matter how much I eat,
my stomach is empty!

12:24.570 --> 12:27.210
My heart is empty.

12:27.210 --> 12:30.080
Ezra, you're well
off because you're happy.

12:30.080 --> 12:33.140
But Dita, you're on good
terms with Hibiki, right?

12:34.620 --> 12:37.680
Mr. Alien said that he hated me.

12:38.690 --> 12:41.420
That's why I'm going
to become a new me!

12:41.420 --> 12:44.860
You're a good enough girl
just the way you are, Dita.

12:44.860 --> 12:46.160
It's no good!

12:46.160 --> 12:47.390
I want to change!

12:52.930 --> 12:55.270
Dita completely breaks down.

13:06.080 --> 13:07.920
Wait a minute!

13:07.920 --> 13:10.150
If you're bored,
why not hang out with me?

13:11.450 --> 13:14.620
Oh, all right. Just for a bit.

13:14.620 --> 13:16.220
What happened to your partner?

13:16.220 --> 13:17.260
Nothing.

13:17.260 --> 13:19.290
Not that one. Dita.

13:19.290 --> 13:20.950
Why the hell is she my partner?

13:22.260 --> 13:24.370
I thought you made
a good combination.

13:24.370 --> 13:25.800
You've got to be kidding.

13:26.800 --> 13:27.790
It's your turn.

13:32.970 --> 13:33.970
I'm in!

13:33.970 --> 13:35.010
You sure?

13:35.010 --> 13:36.810
A man never has second thoughts.

13:36.810 --> 13:38.710
Three of a kind!

13:38.710 --> 13:39.700
Full house.

13:41.950 --> 13:44.320
Wow, how pretty!

13:44.320 --> 13:46.390
So do you like it?

13:46.390 --> 13:47.760
It's amazing, Parfet!

13:47.760 --> 13:50.020
It looks like the
stars are so close by!

13:50.020 --> 13:53.360
This way, I can see
new UFOs and new aliens!

13:55.200 --> 13:56.190
What's wrong?

13:58.800 --> 14:00.700
Nothing at all!

14:00.700 --> 14:02.500
Did you get in a fight with him?

14:05.870 --> 14:07.470
How's this?

14:07.470 --> 14:10.780
Look at this!
A man's distinction... A flush!

14:10.780 --> 14:11.940
Four of a kind.

14:13.280 --> 14:16.280
I'm basically holding back on Mr. Alien.

14:16.280 --> 14:17.610
And why's that?

14:18.990 --> 14:22.790
Mr. Alien said that he gets
tired when he's with me.

14:22.790 --> 14:25.950
So that's why I've
stopped being near him.

14:27.630 --> 14:31.100
I don't think he's that
much of a wuss, though...

14:31.100 --> 14:33.700
Damn it, another useless hand!

14:33.700 --> 14:35.470
Don't get so hot-headed about it!

14:35.470 --> 14:37.770
Shut up! Gimme another hand!

14:38.840 --> 14:42.380
All I wanted to do was
learn more about Mr. Alien.

14:42.380 --> 14:43.840
Hey, Parfet...

14:43.840 --> 14:45.400
Is that so wrong?

14:47.210 --> 14:51.290
When I look at new mechas,
I do want to know how they're built.

14:51.290 --> 14:53.490
You want to know more
about what you like.

14:53.490 --> 14:55.620
Isn't that obvious?

14:55.620 --> 14:56.920
Like?

14:57.930 --> 14:59.230
It's strange, I know.

14:59.230 --> 15:01.890
There's no way a girl would
fall in love with a man.

15:03.460 --> 15:04.450
Oh my.

15:05.970 --> 15:07.800
You know, Dita...

15:07.800 --> 15:11.170
That scope wasn't the only
thing I wanted to show you.

15:11.170 --> 15:13.070
I really want to
show you something else.

15:13.070 --> 15:14.230
Wanna see it?

15:19.480 --> 15:22.880
Virgo. This is the fateful
year of the century.

15:22.880 --> 15:25.590
Be honest with your feelings,
and you will have great fortune.

15:25.590 --> 15:26.790
This...

15:26.790 --> 15:30.220
I added astrology and compatibility
fortunes to this thing.

15:30.220 --> 15:31.660
Compatibility?

15:31.660 --> 15:35.000
Why don't you look up
your compatibility with him?

15:35.000 --> 15:37.260
I already entered the
data for all the crew,

15:37.260 --> 15:39.630
so just push the
keys and enter his name.

15:40.900 --> 15:42.300
But...

15:42.300 --> 15:43.740
It's all right!

15:43.740 --> 15:45.430
Now, hurry up!

16:02.760 --> 16:04.860
I'm in! How's this?

16:04.860 --> 16:05.860
Four of a kind!

16:05.860 --> 16:07.420
Straight flush.

16:14.900 --> 16:16.600
Are you all right, Dita?

16:16.600 --> 16:18.140
I'm sorry!

16:18.140 --> 16:19.110
That's strange...

16:19.110 --> 16:21.540
Maybe there was too much
data in there to handle...

16:22.910 --> 16:24.610
Dita, get a grip!

16:24.610 --> 16:26.910
Come on, open your eyes!

16:28.180 --> 16:30.380
Well, thanks as always!

16:30.380 --> 16:31.910
Please try again!

16:33.520 --> 16:34.660
One more time!

16:34.660 --> 16:36.590
I'll win back everything
with the next one!

16:38.190 --> 16:39.830
Don't bother.

16:39.830 --> 16:43.060
The way you are today,
you can't win no matter what.

16:43.060 --> 16:45.170
Are you running with the winnings?

16:45.170 --> 16:46.570
I don't like that...

16:46.570 --> 16:47.670
Listen up!

16:47.670 --> 16:51.940
This game is about
reading each other's minds.

16:51.940 --> 16:55.810
There's no way someone who's
showing everything can win.

16:55.810 --> 16:56.840
Hmph.

16:56.840 --> 17:00.050
I just don't feel
comfortable for some reason.

17:00.050 --> 17:03.620
You don't feel comfortable
for a different reason, right?

17:03.620 --> 17:05.850
Come again when you settle
the score over there!

17:05.850 --> 17:06.990
Shut up!

17:06.990 --> 17:08.680
You don't have to be so nosy!

17:12.190 --> 17:13.190
Well?

17:13.190 --> 17:14.960
I don't see any signs of illness.

17:14.960 --> 17:16.230
No external wounds either.

17:16.230 --> 17:18.570
Really? I'm so glad!

17:18.570 --> 17:20.930
Have you ever collapsed
like this before?

17:20.930 --> 17:22.300
Never.

17:22.300 --> 17:24.610
Do you remember how
you felt when you collapsed?

17:24.610 --> 17:25.610
Yes.

17:25.610 --> 17:27.010
What were you feeling then?

17:28.080 --> 17:29.510
My heart...

17:29.510 --> 17:32.250
It hurt like it was
being pinched around here.

17:32.250 --> 17:33.180
And it hurt...

17:33.180 --> 17:35.280
I don't know why at all.

17:35.280 --> 17:37.270
When I woke up, I was lying here...

17:39.050 --> 17:41.420
I'm sorry that
it turned out this way...

17:42.420 --> 17:43.490
It's all right!

17:43.490 --> 17:45.890
You were just trying to cheer me up!

17:48.200 --> 17:49.180
Again?

17:50.630 --> 17:51.900
What's wrong?

17:51.900 --> 17:53.230
Nothing to worry about.

17:53.230 --> 17:54.940
This happens every so often.

17:54.940 --> 17:57.470
I'm trying to take some
time to figure it out...

17:57.470 --> 17:59.340
...but I'm really not used to it.

17:59.340 --> 18:00.430
Let me see!

18:04.210 --> 18:05.180
What is this?

18:05.180 --> 18:06.980
This circuit is cut off!

18:06.980 --> 18:08.050
Oh, here too...

18:08.050 --> 18:09.720
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

18:09.720 --> 18:12.790
This isn't a doctor's job!

18:12.790 --> 18:14.250
I apologize.

18:14.250 --> 18:17.520
I didn't want to call
you up after each battle.

18:17.520 --> 18:18.830
Don't be so reserved.

18:18.830 --> 18:20.160
It's my job!

18:20.160 --> 18:22.300
Next time, be sure to call me!

18:22.300 --> 18:23.200
Understood.

18:23.200 --> 18:25.870
Then I'll fix it right now.
Help me out.

18:25.870 --> 18:27.840
First, turn off that
circuit over there...

18:27.840 --> 18:29.000
Are you all right?

18:32.340 --> 18:34.000
Dita...

18:44.820 --> 18:48.660
Mr. Alien isn't happy with me.

18:48.660 --> 18:51.920
You don't feel comfortable
for a different reason, right?

18:59.170 --> 19:00.870
You again?

19:00.870 --> 19:04.740
If you give me more crap,
I'll make sure to break you apart!

19:04.740 --> 19:06.640
Hibiki, are you lonely?

19:06.640 --> 19:07.540
You...

19:07.540 --> 19:08.670
But...

19:09.540 --> 19:11.480
Dita is lonely, too.

19:14.380 --> 19:15.540
Wait a minute!

19:19.250 --> 19:20.240
Damn it!

19:22.220 --> 19:24.820
What the hell do you want me to do?

19:27.030 --> 19:30.230
I believed for the longest time

19:30.230 --> 19:33.200
that someday a UFO would appear

19:33.200 --> 19:37.190
and an alien would take
me to the land of happiness.

19:38.840 --> 19:41.830
I thought that my wish
had been heard and granted.

19:43.510 --> 19:45.450
But it's different now...

19:45.450 --> 19:48.220
I don't care if my wish gets granted.

19:48.220 --> 19:51.450
I'd rather have
Mr. Alien not hate me.

19:52.890 --> 19:55.450
I wonder what's wrong with me?

19:56.390 --> 19:58.160
I...

19:58.160 --> 19:59.960
Mr. Alien...

20:03.800 --> 20:05.360
Huh? That's...

20:07.200 --> 20:08.830
Those are a bad aliens!

20:11.000 --> 20:13.540
It's the enemy!
Contact in two minutes!

20:13.540 --> 20:15.200
Dread team, move out!

20:21.650 --> 20:22.780
Where's Jura?

20:22.780 --> 20:23.720
She's late.

20:23.720 --> 20:25.120
She can't be...

20:25.120 --> 20:27.220
Cheers!

20:27.220 --> 20:31.990
So if I combine with him,
an amazing Dread will be created!

20:31.990 --> 20:34.230
I'm sure it'll be wonderful!

20:34.230 --> 20:37.060
And I'll be the captain of the Nirvana!

20:40.930 --> 20:42.040
I have no choice.

20:42.040 --> 20:43.000
Dita!

20:43.000 --> 20:43.740
Yes?

20:43.740 --> 20:46.140
Dita, I'm going with you and Hibiki!

20:46.140 --> 20:47.270
- But...
- Hey!

20:48.240 --> 20:50.180
I'll tell you one thing right now!

20:50.180 --> 20:52.310
Um, well...

20:52.310 --> 20:54.110
I-In other words, um...

20:55.680 --> 20:56.950
What?

20:56.950 --> 21:00.190
Anyway, just don't do things
that you don't usually do!

21:00.190 --> 21:02.890
Sheesh, you're getting
me all out of whack, too...

21:02.890 --> 21:03.880
Got that?!

21:06.090 --> 21:07.860
Yeah!

21:07.860 --> 21:12.230
All right, if that's been decided,
let's get it on right!

21:20.670 --> 21:22.780
Let's go!

21:22.780 --> 21:23.970
Yahoo!

21:32.150 --> 21:37.760
Hey, you realized what the words,

21:37.760 --> 21:43.260
I really wanted to hear are, right?

21:43.260 --> 21:49.500
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

21:49.500 --> 21:59.810
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

21:59.810 --> 22:02.350
Hey, with all of my body.

22:02.350 --> 22:14.130
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

22:14.130 --> 22:25.740
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

22:25.740 --> 22:37.550
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

22:37.550 --> 22:51.420
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
